From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:18:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Record static inline offsets of absolutely positioned boxes
 when evicting

A root whose absolutely positioned boxes sit at their static inline
position stayed shaped, since its summary knew only each box's line.
Record each box's offset along its line with the inputs that aligned it,
and reuse it only for a layout pass with identical inputs; any other pass
rebuilds the root. Measure passes place no boxes, so they keep breaking
from the summary.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
